msgid "Assistants can then edit titles, authors, tags and ratings, add notes and highlights, mark books read and import books from folders you allow. Metadata edits and imports can be undone in Bookx (Edit → Undo); notes and highlights can be deleted in the reader. Switch this on only for assistants you trust."
